Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||09-01-2000||01:53 AM||||I am realy disapointed with some individuals of the forum lately!<BR>It seems there are some members that need a testostrone fix, and pick fights at vulnerable members that mean no harm!<BR>First off we all have to remember we are all human to exagerate is human! I've done it YOU the reader have done it and we ALL will continue to do it!<P>Why do people find it so amuseing to belittle others? Does it make you feel good?<BR>Does it fill the void in your life that will never be filled?<P>What is the differance between constructive criticism and destructive? It's a fine line we walk on this forum every day! I ask you question your self before you herass others!<P>Sometimes it's good natured fun, but sometimes it gets down right abusive!<P>On a personal note: I feel it is hipocriticle to give negative information that is pure hersay then turn around and attack someone for presumably false representing their ride!<P>Last but not least. I can neither spell nor do I have good english skills. I find it very insulting that because my education might not have been as good as others that you think that me or anyone else doesn't have a right to post on this forum! Maybe you should have spent less time in class and more time learning tact!<P>Flame on! Just a point of view of how people treat others! ||||reg||13
