Z||000003||stimpy||09-01-2000||08:03 AM||||I can't figure out why your feelings are hurt, Fierorocious.  But as someone who admittedly calls 'em as I sees 'em, I feel that I am part of your blanket condemation. In justification for my comments which can be quite direct in nature, I feel that my targets kinda ask for it.  Case in point, Mr. Twin-Turbo guy. Here is someone that has been posting innacuracies and downright impossibilities as fact, and people have been lapping it up!  He has gone so far as to come "this close" to soliciting purchase offers for his "twin-turbo" set up from forum members.  Big time fraud, way beyond a simple fib.  I've made somegentle, and not so gentle hints that such lies are not appropriate, and as he continues to insult our intelligence, I will continue to openly ridicule such stupidity.<P>Now as far as spelling and grammatical errors go, yes, I do think it is ridiculous an arrogant to criticize someone over that.  This is no place for the grammar police.   <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
