Z||000015||Cooter||09-02-2000||07:54 PM||||Sometimes our warped sense of humor doesn't help- A recent thread where the v8 kit guy commented about someone's website, so I made an irrelevant comment back at him- It was a JOKE, to poke fun at the irrelevance of his comment. Well, next I am getting personal "flame mail" and being called names like I was in grammar school again. But back then, I would just beat the piss out of the kids that called me names  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000016||HYPTNOTiSE||09-03-2000||01:24 AM||||Fieroocious, if you're talking about me, then here's my rebutal. Twin turbo guy is a bold face POS liar. It erks me so bad.  I have spent every single penny i have earned this entire summer and over the past 6 month before that, dumping piles of cash into my car.  I'm 19 years old and i'm in college. During the summer and after class,  I work in a 115 degree bodyshop. When i come home from a long day to earn a dollar to fix my fiero, and i hear some lying boast from some highschool punk(not that i wasn't one 2 years ago  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) It makes me very mad.  If I would have known all it took was a few posts saying what mods your fiero has(no matter what is actually done) I would have much rather done that than bust my ass this whole time.  ACTUALLY! hold on a sec.  I take that back, When i'm done at least i'll have something REAL.  <P>I dont mean to have a bad attitude if it sounds like I do.  I dont want to give anyone the wrong impression of myself, I value my integrity most of anything in my life, even above my fiero(pretty damn high).  It's just that lying bullshitting, and blowing smoke are my biggest pet peaves. Dreaming, wishing, and hoping for things is great, as long as it's labeled as such.  ||||reg||1
