Z||000019||FIEROCIOUS||09-03-2000||01:37 PM||||Oh Haze, I've been parting out a 87 GT I bought for 400.00 it was loaded factory sub everything! Had pearl purple paint been striping it. Body is sold and now takeing the rest out today! Any of you have tan interior this car had realy nice interior also!<P>Don't belive me? Ask SCCA Fiero! LOL<P>I'm not upset just pointed out an observation!<P>Hyptno buddy nothin but love baby! I don't target individuals just trends!<P>Well moonie? he ticked me a bit? Oh well? take it how you take it right! <P>People do need to practice some "class"  If for no reason other than to preserve this forum!<p>[This message has been edited by FIEROCIOUS (edited 09-03-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000020||Ozzy||09-03-2000||01:51 PM||||Just my 2 Rubels worth...<P>Fierocious...I don't know what tore your nighty but I know that you have been a positive contributor to this forum and on that strength only should I base my opinion. It's hard to get a feel for people's REAL personalities here. Unless I have met them, I am basing my opinion on a piece of text only...that's kinda like listening to a DJ on the radio for years; you build an unconscious mental image of what they look like. When you see them in person for the first time, the physical and the audible don't seem to match.<P>We have had these discussions before...I have not been around much do to a newborn and career changes. I don't want to become a lightening rod and feel that I have not contributed much to lash out with a BIG opinion. In fact I'm not sure that any of us humble servants have that right in the end...I do believe we have the responsibility to keep each other honest just as in ANY large family but with a modicum of tact and "friendly" approach.<P>NOw that I've written another bloody book...If you look at the response of your brutha's (& sista's???) It was taken fairly much in the spirit intended, I think, and THAT is one of the reasons I beleive this is such a kool forum!<P><BR>Ozzy||||reg||10
